From bdd794e978bd5e800cf9ce8fab6fab7cbae61551 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 102464 <pxesrv@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 22:22:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] telephony: add no-op TelephonyMetrics stub for MTK IMS
 blobs

AOSP commit a1e87f8d20 removed the legacy clearcut metrics class, but
stock MTK IMS blobs (com.mediatek.ims ImsRILAdapter, com.mediatek.wfo
MwiRIL) still reference its methods. Without the stub the persistent ims
process dies with NoClassDefFoundError and RescueParty reboots the device.

Signatures match the pre-removal AOSP implementation; all methods are no-ops.

Change-Id: I9648f951269c73137e6b1abff71803e8f3134514
---
 .../telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java   | 50 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 50 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java

diff --git a/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java b/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..54be8482c3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java
@@ -0,0 +1,50 @@
